%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: WeirdRouteYuriKonsequence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, did you need something, Sayori?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791057
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: In the original game, could people hear strange voices and get possessed?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791058
    - rid: 4351268190826791059
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791061
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, did that happen to you, Sayori?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: No, it happened to Yuri when were in Saarthal.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791062
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: When they were at Saarthal? That changes things.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Being able to hear strange voices is actually pretty common, the Daedric
      Princes often do it, and it'll even happen later in the questline.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But at Saarthal? And being possessed?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure the closest thing to possession that happens is Sanguine's
      quest where the player character gets incredibly drunk...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, we'll need more details from Yuri.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, {mc}, Monika already left, what are you still doing here-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791060
    - rid: 4351268190826791064
    - rid: 4351268190826791066
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori said you heard a strange voice and got possessed at Saarthal.
      Why didn't you mention that sooner?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791065
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, well, I was already wasting your time with my problems, so I thought-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri. This is very serious.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791067
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And in case you forgot, you are worth caring about.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791068
    - rid: 4351268190826791071
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, what did this strange voice sound like?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791072
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The voice... didn't really have a sound.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791069
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I knew what it was saying, and it <i>was</i> speaking Japa-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=glitchfont>English.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791073
    - rid: 4972360475574796417
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: But it wasn't making any sounds. If that makes sense.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791076
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... well that rules out pretty much anything Tamriel and Oblivion can
      offer...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And this possession, did it come from touching something, or doing something
      specific?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791077
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure that the strange voice was behind it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791079
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... is that normal?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791080
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Absolutely not!!!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791083
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: In fact, I'm not entirely sure what to do about that... this kind of
      thing doesn't happen in the original game.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791082
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Does this... "voice" constantly talk to you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: It only "spoke" to me twice, both times in Saarthal.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791084
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright so this strange voice <i>seems</i> to be limited.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Whether or not it actually is? It's too early to say.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, well, since I've never really seen something like this before...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791085
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'I think the best course of action is to either remember or document
      these possessions if they happen again:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791086
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The situations that cause them to occur, what the strange voice says,
      anything that could be important.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry I couldn't help more...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791088
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... It's alright, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791087
    - rid: 4351268190826791089
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anything else pressing and existentially disturbing that I need to know
      about?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791090
    - rid: 4351268190826791091
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't think so...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, well I'm heading out for real then.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Stay safe, you two.
    ScreenActions: []
